    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="1ed58dee-6317-54fc-8fe2-814f875eae9e" activityNameId="8947d263-75a8-5a1c-a31e-c8642ff09405" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Potentiometer, unspecified, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Potentiometer, unspecified, at plant
The data represent a typical potentiometer, used in the information and communication technology. Material data are taken from the literature. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset represents 1 kg of potentiometers with a weight of 6.1 gram/unit. Production efforts data was updated in 2023; UUID: 458e453e-2912-3f17-a04e-31e957bcce31
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of potentiometers (the variable resistor type).
Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of potentiometers.
Technology: Average technology for the production of resistors and potentiometers - comprising terminmation printing; resistive body printing; glass coat printing; laser trimming; substrate stripping (SMT) resp. ceramic rods; deposition processes; ageing; capping (THT) resp. printing; curing; punching; revetting; molding (ptoentiom.)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_458e453e-2912-3f17-a04e-31e957bcce31.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
